%% Diagram 1 — HLD: System Architecture (what we actually shipped on Google ADK / GCP)
%% Legend: gray = agent-executed phase | amber = human decision gate | teal = published artifact
%% Every node names its artifact; every gate names the decision that blocks it.
flowchart TB
    IN(["Intake trigger<br/>plain-language data request"]):::ext --> ORCH

    ORCH["pdlc_coordinator · root_agent<br/>(Coordinator-Dispatcher, fast model)<br/><i>artifact: routing decision → 1 specialist</i>"]:::agent

    subgraph Phases [PDLC phase specialists · one artifact each]
      direction TB
      P0["Phase 0 · intake_triage_agent<br/><i>artifact: triage note</i>"]:::agent
      P1["Phase 1 · requirements_analyst_agent<br/><i>artifact: Requirement Analysis v1.x</i>"]:::agent
      P2["Phase 2 · architecture_agent<br/><i>artifact: HLD + cost proposal + ADR log</i>"]:::agent
      P5["Phase 5 · iac_agent (runs FIRST, post-approval)<br/><i>artifact: Terraform in repo</i>"]:::agent
      P4["Phase 4 · jira_planner_agent<br/><i>artifact: Epic→Feature→Story→Task + AC</i>"]:::agent
    end

    ORCH -->|Phase 0| P0
    ORCH -->|Phase 1| P1
    ORCH -->|Phase 2| P2
    ORCH -->|Phase 5| P5
    ORCH -->|Phase 4| P4

    P1 --> G1{{"Gate-1 · Requirement sign-off<br/>blocks until human approval<br/>recorded in session.state"}}:::gate
    G1 -->|approved| P2
    G1 -->|revise → v1.1| P1

    P2 --> G2{{"Gate-2 · Architecture review<br/>approve / conditional / reject<br/>save refused w/o record_human_approval"}}:::gate
    G2 -->|approved| P5
    G2 -->|conditional / reject| P2

    P5 --> P4

    RS[("researcher_agent<br/>google_search grounding<br/><i>real web facts, not memory</i>")]:::tool
    P1 -.delegates facts.-> RS
    P2 -.delegates facts.-> RS

    subgraph ToolLayer [Tool + MCP layer · deterministic tools + GCP-native grounding]
      direction LR
      T1[("decide_load_pattern<br/>deterministic tree")]:::tool
      T2[("estimate_gcp_cost<br/>ROM calculator")]:::tool
      T3[("get_architecture_standard<br/>repo standard doc")]:::tool
      T4[("Dev-Knowledge MCP<br/>Google's own docs")]:::tool
      T5[("generate_terraform_skeleton")]:::tool
      T6[("check_task_traceability")]:::tool
    end
    P2 --> T1 & T2 & T3 & T4
    P5 --> T4 & T5
    P4 --> T6

    subgraph Guards [Structural guardrails · before_tool_callback, raises + refuses]
      GA["approval gate<br/>ApprovalRequiredError"]:::guard
      GG["grounding gate<br/>GroundingRequiredError"]:::guard
      GL["tool-call ceiling"]:::guard
    end
    P2 -.enforced by.-> GA
    P5 -.enforced by.-> GA
    P1 -.enforced by.-> GG

    OBS(["Observability · Cloud Trace (OTel) + BigQuery Agent Analytics<br/>one nested trace per request_id"]):::ext
    OBS -.traces every node.-> ORCH
    OBS -.-> Phases
    OBS -.-> ToolLayer

    %% Unhappy paths: Gate reject → loop back with reason; grounding/approval missing → tool refuses;
    %% research source down → researcher reports uncertainty instead of guessing.

    classDef agent fill:#E8EAED,stroke:#5F6368,color:#202124;
    classDef gate fill:#FCE8B2,stroke:#B06000,color:#3D2C00;
    classDef tool fill:#A7D7D2,stroke:#2A6F6A,color:#0C302D;
    classDef guard fill:#F4C7C3,stroke:#A50E0E,color:#3D0A0A;
    classDef ext fill:#FFFFFF,stroke:#9AA0A6,color:#3C4043,stroke-dasharray:4 3;
